        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.5</title>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 04:54:02 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Active-High LED Wiring Support</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Feature</b>: Support active-high LED wiring in addition to the existing active-low default; switchable from the wiring-calibration wizard.<br>支持高电平点亮的 LED 接线（此前仅支持低电平点亮默认值）；可在接线校准向导中随时切换。</li>
                    <li><b>Fix</b>: Firmware no longer misjudges a normal restart (power-cycle or firmware update) as a brownout deathloop.<br>修复固件误判正常重启（断电重连或固件更新）为欠压死循环的问题。</li>
                    <li><b>Fix</b>: The signal light now restores its real state immediately after wiring calibration finishes, instead of staying dark until you tap Done.<br>修复接线校准完成后灯光需要等待才恢复正常显示的问题，现在校准一结束就会立即恢复。</li>
                    <li><b>Firmware</b>: ESP32-C3 signal-light firmware updated to 1.3.0 — check for it from Settings &rarr; Signal Light after installing this app update.<br>信号灯固件更新至 1.3.0，安装本次 App 更新后可在设置 &rarr; 信号灯里检查固件更新。</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/itdragons/open-vibe-island/releases/download/wg-v1.0.5/WG.Open.Island-1.0.5.zip"
